  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "It's not always easy to make up stories around problems ― like this one.\n\nWe know that there is a hidden sequence A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​ which contains only integers between 111 and KKK inclusive. We have acquired MMM triplets (X1,Y1,Z1),(X2,Y2,Z2),…,(XM,YM,ZM)(X_1, Y_1, Z_1), (X_2, Y_2, Z_2), \\ldots, (X_M, Y_M, Z_M)(X1​,Y1​,Z1​),(X2​,Y2​,Z2​),…,(XM​,YM​,ZM​). A very reliable source has given us intel that for each valid iii, the YiY_iYi​-th occurrence of the integer XiX_iXi​ in the sequence AAA is AZiA_{Z_i}AZi​​, i.e. AZi=XiA_{Z_i} = X_iAZi​​=Xi​ and there are Yi−1Y_i-1Yi​−1 indices j&lt;Zij \\lt Z_ij&lt;Zi​ such that Aj=XiA_j = X_iAj​=Xi​.\n\nFind any sequence AAA consistent with this information or determine that no such sequence exists.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤5⋅1051 \\le T \\le 5 \\cdot 10^51≤T≤5⋅105",
      "1≤N,K,M≤5⋅1051 \\le N, K, M \\le 5 \\cdot 10^51≤N,K,M≤5⋅105",
      "1≤Xi≤K1 \\le X_i \\le K1≤Xi​≤K for each valid iii",
      "1≤Yi,Zi≤N1 \\le Y_i, Z_i \\le N1≤Yi​,Zi​≤N for each valid iii",
      "all triplets are pairwise distinct",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 5⋅1055 \\cdot 10^55⋅105",
      "the sum of KKK over all test cases does not exceed 5⋅1055 \\cdot 10^55⋅105",
      "the sum of MMM over all test cases does not exceed 5⋅1055 \\cdot 10^55⋅105"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains three space-separated integers NNN, KKK and MMM.\nMMM lines follow. For each iii (1≤i≤M1 \\le i \\le M1≤i≤M), the iii-th of these lines contains three space-separated integers Xi,YiX_i, Y_iXi​,Yi​ and ZiZ_iZi​.",
    "outputFormat": "For each test case:\n\n\nIf no valid sequence exists, print a single line containing the string `\"No\"`.\nOtherwise, print two lines.\nThe first of these lines should contain the string `\"Yes\"`.\nThe second line should contain NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.",
